<h2 id="results">
Model accuracy</h2>
<p>Exact correctness requires the complete answer and required format. The headline weights all 19 families
equally. The micro score weights questions equally. A truncated or malformed returned answer is incorrect; an
unreturned request is missing. Required capacity recoveries remain provisional. Incomplete rows show lower–upper
bounds for missing responses and pending recoveries, not confidence intervals.
Output-limit truncation means the endpoint's declared output ceiling was reached. Context exhaustion means
the full remaining prompt-plus-output window was consumed. Provider cutoffs below the requested allowance
and interrupted streams are collection failures, not incorrect answers. Truncation and format-error counts
can overlap.</p>

